- **`#297` GUARDED the casts; it did NOT remove them (`READ`).** In [`X(ftrc_frm_fpul)`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/cpus/cpu_sh_instr.c#L2943-L3040), both the `PR=1` double-precision arm ([`:3016`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/cpus/cpu_sh_instr.c#L3016)) and the `PR=0` single-precision arm ([`:3038`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/cpus/cpu_sh_instr.c#L3038)) still execute `cpu->cd.sh.fpul = (int32_t) op1.f;` inside the `else` branch of the raw-bit NaN/exponent/boundary ladders (`:2996-3014` and `:3020-3036`).
