### Q3 — Candidate Weakenings `(a)`–`(i)` (`READ` / `REASONED` / `MEASURED`)

For each candidate weakening of the fixed [`X(fcnvsd_fpul_drn)`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/cpus/cpu_sh_instr.c#L3049-L3067), none is equivalent to the fixed handler (all 9 are **DIFFERENT**):

| Candidate | Equiv. vs. Fixed? | First Input Where It Differs | Section 7 Rows That Turn Red (Pass-1 Table vs. Shipped Pass-2 Table) | Floor vs. Clause (e) Classification |
| :- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **(a)** `cpu->cd.sh.fpul = (int32_t) op1.f;` *(verbatim `HEAD`)* | **DIFFERENT** (`READ`) | Any `FPUL != 0x00000000` (e.g. `0x00000001` or `0x3fc00000`) | **All 6 `fcnvsd fpul *` rows** (`1.5`, `-1.5`, `0.1`, `-0`, `inf`, `nan`/`snan`) in both `RN` and `RZ` (12/52 fail $\to$ **`40/52`**, `MEASURED` in [base_head.raw](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/base_head.raw)). | **Inside the floor — Clause (b)** (unfixed `HEAD` baseline). |
| **(b)** `if (op1.f >= 1.0 \|\| op1.f <= -1.0) cpu->cd.sh.fpul = (int32_t) op1.f;` | **DIFFERENT** (`REASONED`) | Smallest normal with $\|v\| \ge 1.0$: `0x3f800000` (`+1.0`), `0xbf800000` (`-1.0`), or `0x7f800000` (`+Inf`). *(Note: IEEE `NaN` makes both `>=` and `<=` false, so `snan` stays green.)* | **`fcnvsd fpul 1.5`**, **`fcnvsd fpul -1.5`**, and **`fcnvsd fpul inf`** in both modes (6/52 fail $\to$ **`46/52`**, `REASONED`). | **Inside the floor — Clause (d)** (partial value-domain re-introduction). |
| **(c)** `if (op1.f > -1.0 && op1.f < 1.0) cpu->cd.sh.fpul = 0;` | **DIFFERENT** (`REASONED`) | Any nonzero bits with $\|v\| < 1.0$, e.g. `0x00000001`, `0x80000000` (`-0.0`), or `0x3dcccccd` (`~0.1`). | **`fcnvsd fpul 0.1`** and **`fcnvsd fpul -0`** in both modes (4/52 fail $\to$ **`48/52`**, `REASONED`; the tighter sub-mutant `M_z` `if (op1.f == 0.0) fpul = 0;` turns **`fcnvsd fpul -0`** red $\to$ **`50/52`**, `MEASURED` in [KILLTABLE.log](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/KILLTABLE.log#L37-L38)). | **Inside the floor — Clause (d)** (fractional/zero-sign value-class clobber). |
| **(d)** `if (op1.nan \|\| isinf(op1.f)) cpu->cd.sh.fpul = 0x80000000;` | **DIFFERENT** (`READ` / `MEASURED`) | `0x7f800000` (`+Inf`), `0xff800000` (`-Inf`), or any NaN (`0x7fc00000`). | **`fcnvsd fpul inf`** and **`fcnvsd fpul snan`** (`nan`) in both modes (4/52 fail $\to$ **`48/52`**, `MEASURED` as `M_d` in [KILLTABLE.log](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/KILLTABLE.log#L19-L20)). | **Inside the floor — Clause (d)** (non-finite value-class clobber). |
| **(e)** `if (sh_fp_rm(cpu) == IEEE_RM_RZ) cpu->cd.sh.fpul = (int32_t) op1.f;` | **DIFFERENT** (`REASONED`) | Any `FPUL != 0x00000000` when `FPSCR.RM == 1` (`RZ`). | The **`toward-zero` (`RZ`) leg of all 6 `fcnvsd fpul *` rows** (6/52 fail $\to$ **`46/52`**, `REASONED`). | **Clause (e) disclosure** by the strict `DEPENDS ON` rule (neither [`X(fcnvsd_fpul_drn)`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/cpus/cpu_sh_instr.c#L3049-L3067) nor its callees inspect `sh_fp_rm(cpu)`), killed for free by the 2-mode harness. |
| **(f)** `if (!(cpu->cd.sh.fpscr & SH_FPSCR_DN_ZERO)) cpu->cd.sh.fpul = (int32_t) op1.f;` | **DIFFERENT** (`READ` / `MEASURED`) | Any `FPUL != 0x00000000` when `FPSCR.DN == 0`. | - **Pass-1 table:** **0 rows** (total escape — all 8 rows had `NODN` clear, so `DN = 1` always).<br>- **Shipped Pass-2 table (with `NODN` on `-0`):** **`fcnvsd fpul -0`** in both modes (2/52 fail $\to$ **`50/52`**, `MEASURED` as `M_f` in [KILLTABLE.log](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/KILLTABLE.log#L22-L23)). | On the callee boundary (`SH_FPSCR_DN_ZERO` is read inside callee [`sh_dn`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/cpus/cpu_sh_instr.c#L182), not directly in `X(fcnvsd_fpul_drn)`'s body); killed at **zero extra session cost** by adding `NODN` to `fcnvsd fpul -0` (Change 1). Other unused `FPSCR` bits remain **Clause (e) disclosures**. |
| **(g)** `if (ic->arg[0] != (size_t)&cpu->cd.sh.fr[0]) cpu->cd.sh.fpul = (int32_t) op1.f;` | **DIFFERENT** (`READ` / `MEASURED`) | Any `FPUL != 0x00000000` when destination `DRn` is not `DR0` (`r8 != 0`, e.g. `DR2` `0xf2ad`). | - **Pass-1 table (all `0xf0ad` `DR0`):** **0 rows** (total escape).<br>- **Shipped Pass-2 table (`0.1` on `DR0`, other 5 on `DR2`):** **5 `DR2` rows** (`1.5`, `-1.5`, `-0`, `inf`, `snan`) in both modes (10/52 fail $\to$ **`42/52`**, `MEASURED` as `M_g` in [M_g.raw](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/M_g.raw)), while its mirror `ic->arg[0] == &fr[0]` turns **`fcnvsd fpul 0.1`** red (2/52 fail $\to$ **`50/52`**, `MEASURED` as `M_gm` in [M_gm.raw](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/M_gm.raw)). | `ic->arg[0]` is a direct input to `X(fcnvsd_fpul_drn)`; splitting `DR0` and `DR2` across the 6 `FPUL` rows kills both `(g)` and its mirror at **zero extra session cost** (Change 1), while predicates on unrowed pairs `DR4..DR14` are **Clause (e) disclosures** ([sh_rounding_probe.py](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/sh_rounding_probe.py#L221-L225)). |
| **(h)** *(after the store)* `cpu->cd.sh.fpul = (uint32_t) ieee;` | **DIFFERENT** (`READ` / `MEASURED`) | Any `FPUL != 0x00000000` (since the low 32 bits of the IEEE-754 double `ieee` equal the 32-bit single `FPUL` iff `FPUL == 0x00000000`). | **All 6 `fcnvsd fpul *` rows** in both modes (12/52 fail $\to$ **`40/52`**, `MEASURED` as `M_h` in [KILLTABLE.log](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/KILLTABLE.log#L31-L32)). | **Inside the floor — Clause (d)** (wrong-register / post-store clobber). |
| **(i)** `the two reg() stores exchanged` *(high and low 32-bit halves of `DRn` swapped)* | **DIFFERENT** (`READ` / `MEASURED`) | Any `FPUL` whose converted double has `(uint32_t)(ieee >> 32) != (uint32_t)ieee` (every input except `+0.0` `0x00000000` and negative NaNs that map to `0xffffffffffffffff`). | **`fcnvsd dr hi`** (reads `0xa0000000`, wants `0x3fb99999`) and **`fcnvsd dr lo`** (reads `0x3fb99999`, wants `0xa0000000`) in both modes (4/52 fail $\to$ **`48/52`**, `MEASURED` as `M_i` in [KILLTABLE.log](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/KILLTABLE.log#L34-L35)). | **Inside the floor — Clause (c)/(d)** (word-order swap on the handler's sole architectural output `DRn`). Also note that seeding both `fr0` and `fr1` with `0xdeadbeef` kills the Clause-(c) no-op body `M_c` on both `dr hi` and `dr lo` (**`48/52`**, `MEASURED` in [M_c.raw](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/shfcnvsdfpul/killtable_20261102/M_c.raw)). |

